        "id": 55127,
        "name": "jagarciao",
        "username": "jagarciao",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jagarciao/{size}/2010_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-13T21:37:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One time, while waiting for some friends to show up so we could hit the bars, we decided to play a quick game against Baron Blade. To make it more silly and fun we added the rule that highest HP at the end of the game would \"win\" at first the attacks were subtle, with people just sniping ay each other to keep them below their own HP while still taking care of the Baron, but eventually it degraded to a free-for-all... then we decided that each player that became incapacitated would have to buy a round we got to the bars... if we still managed to win. Hilarity ensued, but we all ended up dead.&nbsp;</p><p>We keep talking about playing like this again sometime, but haven't really followed through with it.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:29:46.411Z",
