        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Alex\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/alex/48/2059_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Alex:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This one guy who played as Tempest kept on <em>trying </em>to get killed because he likes the incapacitated side so much.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I've thought about doing that. Tempest's incapacitated side is OP. One of the effects is better than Legacy's Lead from the Front/Next Evolution combo. I think if we purposely kill Tempest and get Legacy's combo out we can shut down all Melee and Projectile so the Chairman can do nothing. Autowin.</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
