        "raw": "[quote=\"Alex\"]\n\nThis one guy who played as Tempest kept on <em>trying </em>to get killed because he likes the incapacitated side so much.\n\n[/quote]\n\nI&#39;ve thought about doing that. Tempest&#39;s incapacitated side is OP. One of the effects is better than Legacy&#39;s Lead from the Front/Next Evolution combo. I think if we purposely kill Tempest and get Legacy&#39;s combo out we can shut down all Melee and Projectile so the Chairman can do nothing. Autowin.\n",
